ng and typically uses a bar that either moves horizontally or vertically?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Deadbolts are often added to exterior doors because their solid bar is harder to force back than a spring latch.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-7031-a2bc-e4d0f08f67dc","description":"Deadbolt","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-74bb-8e5b-182609455cd6","description":"Padlock","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-73a7-af48-b1c18ee3f7b0","description":"Combination lock","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-7bcf-a8e7-2bf2b6a863fe","description":"Digital lock","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-72ac-bd4d-dffa9e65b093","category":"01a21312-b489-7095-8a30-44480fe2c4f5","question":"What kind of officer is charged with providing clothing, fuel, and transportation for troops?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"A quartermaster is a logistics officer; sergeant, major, and captain are military ranks, not the supply-and-transport role described here.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-712d-9cc4-903bb9abab88","description":"A quartermaster","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-78e3-ba9b-9c4415b80b23","description":"A sergeant","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-7125-91a3-15bd8c758aa8","description":"A major","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-73a8-a9ae-962a68974239","description":"A captain","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-7bc6-bbf5-bab8b53034c5","category":"01a21312-b489-7095-8a30-44480fe2c4f5","question":"What color is carmine?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Carmine is a vivid red pigment traditionally made from cochineal insects and used in foods and artists\u2019 paints.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-7caf-9526-8044bd36480b","description":"Red","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-7bdf-abd5-aba4d11ad653","description":"Yellow","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-7966-9f6f-584fbd55eeb0","description":"Blue","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae36-7ee8-933a-564d637